1
00:00:43,274 --> 00:00:46,544
=Born Again=

2
00:00:46,544 --> 00:00:49,558
=Episode 19=

3
00:00:50,440 --> 00:00:51,880
I do have a way.

4
00:00:51,880 --> 00:00:53,240
It just depends on

5
00:00:53,240 --> 00:00:54,840
whether you have the guts

6
00:00:54,840 --> 00:00:56,520
and the appetite for it.

7
00:00:57,640 --> 00:00:59,480
Ms. Lei, don't listen to her nonsense.

8
00:00:59,480 --> 00:01:00,680
Nobody asked you.

9
00:01:01,160 --> 00:01:02,191
Get lost.

10
00:01:07,840 --> 00:01:09,520
Go buy up Red Star Steel's
internal shares

11
00:01:09,920 --> 00:01:11,280
right now.

12
00:01:11,280 --> 00:01:14,760
Use cash to drive the price down
to 60 or 70 percent of face value.

13
00:01:15,120 --> 00:01:17,200
Buy as much as you can
get your hands on.

14
00:01:17,640 --> 00:01:20,120
You'll be rolling in it
before you know it.

15
00:01:21,600 --> 00:01:22,882
You're just bluffing.

16
00:01:23,280 --> 00:01:24,389
Ridiculous.

17
00:01:24,920 --> 00:01:27,440
Ms. Lei, those shares
are just waste paper right now.

18
00:01:27,440 --> 00:01:28,535
Why would we buy them?

19
00:01:29,920 --> 00:01:31,440
If I'm not mistaken,

20
00:01:32,200 --> 00:01:34,787
your family is already
planning to do this.

21
00:01:36,080 --> 00:01:38,485
What? Trying to get rich

22
00:01:38,920 --> 00:01:39,920
behind Ms. Lei's back?

23
00:01:42,640 --> 00:01:43,690
Hey, boy.

24
00:01:44,400 --> 00:01:45,432
Trying to play dirty?

25
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:47,014
Tell me,

26
00:01:47,520 --> 00:01:48,692
is what she said true?

27
00:01:48,720 --> 00:01:49,750
N-No.

28
00:01:50,720 --> 00:01:51,727
I don't care.

29
00:01:51,727 --> 00:01:53,560
Transfer all the shares
you can get to me,

30
00:01:53,720 --> 00:01:55,360
at the price

31
00:01:55,360 --> 00:01:56,360
Xiaotang named.

32
00:01:56,600 --> 00:01:58,960
Otherwise, I'll make you
regret having those hands.

33
00:01:59,760 --> 00:02:00,876
Heard me?

34
00:02:04,120 --> 00:02:05,400
Y-Yes.

35
00:02:08,520 --> 00:02:10,840
Xiaotang, is this intel solid?

36
00:02:11,480 --> 00:02:12,800
What? Don't you trust me?

37
00:02:13,200 --> 00:02:14,256
Yes.

38
00:02:14,360 --> 00:02:16,000
I trust you, of course.

39
00:02:16,960 --> 00:02:18,680
If this really works out,

40
00:02:19,240 --> 00:02:21,513
you'll be the leader here.

41
00:02:22,720 --> 00:02:25,080
I have no interest in being the leader.

42
00:02:25,560 --> 00:02:26,800
Just don't break the law.

43
00:02:28,040 --> 00:02:29,123
Deal.

44
00:02:29,600 --> 00:02:30,704
I'm off then.

45
00:02:34,520 --> 00:02:35,642
What are you waiting for?

46
00:02:35,720 --> 00:02:36,786
Move!

47
00:02:40,120 --> 00:02:41,146
Farewell to Xiaotang.

48
00:02:42,400 --> 00:02:43,840
- Take care, Ms. Xiaotang.
- Take care, Ms. Xiaotang.

49
00:02:55,680 --> 00:02:56,761
Gu Xiaotang,

50
00:02:56,880 --> 00:02:58,560
so you really can predict the future.

51
00:02:58,560 --> 00:03:00,240
Of course. Believe me now?

52
00:03:00,240 --> 00:03:01,313
Then what about them?

53
00:03:01,360 --> 00:03:02,440
Don't worry.

54
00:03:02,440 --> 00:03:04,712
I will never let them
do anything illegal.

55
00:03:05,520 --> 00:03:06,732
To be honest,

56
00:03:06,840 --> 00:03:08,200
I noticed you've changed recently.

57
00:03:08,960 --> 00:03:10,238
You seem different.

58
00:03:10,520 --> 00:03:11,648
Me?

59
00:03:13,400 --> 00:03:15,200
You might not believe it.

60
00:03:15,200 --> 00:03:16,360
To you,

61
00:03:16,680 --> 00:03:17,800
I have changed into who I am

62
00:03:17,800 --> 00:03:19,040
in a few days.

63
00:03:19,040 --> 00:03:20,160
But to me,

64
00:03:20,160 --> 00:03:23,405
she already feels very far away.

65
00:03:28,480 --> 00:03:29,800
I do have changed now.

66
00:03:30,720 --> 00:03:32,720
But I changed because of you.

67
00:03:33,000 --> 00:03:34,360
It is you who have been with me.

68
00:03:35,000 --> 00:03:37,240
When I was at loss
and couldn't find the way out,

69
00:03:37,920 --> 00:03:39,000
you never gave up on me.

70
00:03:41,640 --> 00:03:43,040
Sometimes I think,

71
00:03:43,640 --> 00:03:45,440
if the loop never ends,

72
00:03:45,440 --> 00:03:47,280
with you by my side,

73
00:03:47,280 --> 00:03:48,720
it seems less terrifying.

74
00:03:55,600 --> 00:03:56,600
What's going on?

75
00:03:58,520 --> 00:03:59,840
Probably a short circuit.

76
00:04:08,760 --> 00:04:09,917
Your heart is racing.

77
00:04:15,560 --> 00:04:16,920
Is it always racing like this?

78
00:04:41,960 --> 00:04:44,800
Do you really have a crush on someone?

79
00:04:45,360 --> 00:04:46,840
Who is she? Do I know her?

80
00:04:46,840 --> 00:04:48,017
Is she a classmate of ours?

81
00:04:48,280 --> 00:04:50,520
- Come on, tell me.
- N-No one.

82
00:04:52,440 --> 00:04:53,520
I remember now.

83
00:04:53,520 --> 00:04:54,560
You told me about

84
00:04:54,560 --> 00:04:55,600
a crush in high school.

85
00:04:56,240 --> 00:04:57,960
So your regret is

86
00:05:01,720 --> 00:05:02,880
not confessing to her?

87
00:05:05,000 --> 00:05:06,080
Ye Shen.

88
00:05:06,560 --> 00:05:08,360
Look, I'm pretty capable now.

89
00:05:08,720 --> 00:05:10,400
So if you need my help,

90
00:05:10,400 --> 00:05:11,560
just let me know.

91
00:05:11,560 --> 00:05:13,120
I'll help you with anything.

92
00:05:13,400 --> 00:05:14,480
Ye Shen.

93
00:05:14,640 --> 00:05:15,920
I'll do anything for you.

94
00:05:18,040 --> 00:05:21,400
Will you really do anything for me?

95
00:05:21,600 --> 00:05:22,656
Of course.

96
00:05:23,000 --> 00:05:24,400
But you'd better hurry

97
00:05:24,400 --> 00:05:26,080
and seize the chance.

98
00:05:26,760 --> 00:05:28,600
If I get back one day,

99
00:05:28,600 --> 00:05:29,920
I won't be able to help you.

100
00:05:29,920 --> 00:05:31,040
It'll be too late then.

101
00:05:32,400 --> 00:05:33,525
Gu Xiaotang!

102
00:05:34,760 --> 00:05:35,801
What is it?

103
00:05:36,800 --> 00:05:37,864
I like...

104
00:05:49,560 --> 00:05:50,689
What did you say?

105
00:05:51,520 --> 00:05:52,538
I said...

106
00:05:55,760 --> 00:05:56,877
I got it.

107
00:05:58,520 --> 00:06:00,360
I'm leaving. Go home then.

108
00:06:01,360 --> 00:06:02,435
See you tomorrow.

109
00:06:06,680 --> 00:06:07,760
(Let's take a photo.)

110
00:06:08,160 --> 00:06:09,328
Look at the camera.

111
00:06:09,440 --> 00:06:11,480
Three, two, one.

112
00:06:11,480 --> 00:06:12,520
Cheese!

113
00:06:14,560 --> 00:06:15,880
Does my makeup look good today?

114
00:06:17,520 --> 00:06:18,680
Not bad.

115
00:06:18,880 --> 00:06:21,640
Is there anything different
from yesterday?

116
00:06:26,240 --> 00:06:27,480
You lost an eyelash.

117
00:06:41,080 --> 00:06:42,149
To the rightful owner.

118
00:06:56,200 --> 00:06:57,720
Mom, I'm home.

119
00:06:59,400 --> 00:07:00,560
What's for dinner?

120
00:07:04,760 --> 00:07:05,822
Where's the money?

121
00:07:06,080 --> 00:07:07,286
Where did you hide it?

122
00:07:07,680 --> 00:07:09,400
- Mom?
- Don't think I don't know.

123
00:07:10,080 --> 00:07:11,560
Ms. Lei told me

124
00:07:11,560 --> 00:07:12,598
my debt is all paid off!

125
00:07:13,480 --> 00:07:15,600
- Did you hide money from me,
- Mom!

126
00:07:16,000 --> 00:07:17,280
and didn't pay off my debt?

127
00:07:17,280 --> 00:07:19,360
- I'll call the police.
- Want to get me killed?

128
00:07:22,520 --> 00:07:24,360
You're back just in time, you brat!

129
00:07:24,640 --> 00:07:26,840
Tell me, did you hide the money?

130
00:07:27,120 --> 00:07:28,160
Give it to me right now,

131
00:07:28,520 --> 00:07:29,520
- You animal!
- or I'll beat you!

132
00:07:30,120 --> 00:07:31,312
You animal!

133
00:07:31,520 --> 00:07:33,280
Don't you dare hurt my mom!

134
00:07:33,280 --> 00:07:34,880
- I'll kill you!
- How dare you!

135
00:07:35,160 --> 00:07:36,240
How dare you fight back?

136
00:07:36,240 --> 00:07:37,800
I'll beat you to death!

137
00:07:38,040 --> 00:07:39,092
Stop it!

138
00:07:39,120 --> 00:07:40,120
I'll fight you!

139
00:07:43,280 --> 00:07:44,372
Mom!

140
00:07:45,920 --> 00:07:47,240
Let me tell you,

141
00:07:48,120 --> 00:07:50,400
paying off my debt

142
00:07:50,400 --> 00:07:51,480
doesn't make you king.

143
00:07:51,680 --> 00:07:52,836
Tell me!

144
00:07:52,960 --> 00:07:54,760
How much money did you hide?

145
00:07:55,280 --> 00:07:57,280
Where did all that money come from?

146
00:07:58,320 --> 00:07:59,560
You must have more.

147
00:08:00,040 --> 00:08:01,680
Give it all to me.

148
00:08:02,040 --> 00:08:03,240
If you don't,

149
00:08:03,640 --> 00:08:05,480
I'll beat you every single day.

150
00:08:06,200 --> 00:08:08,400
How dare you hide money from me!

151
00:08:08,920 --> 00:08:10,001
Bah!

152
00:08:12,360 --> 00:08:13,474
Mom.

153
00:08:13,720 --> 00:08:14,863
Mom.

154
00:08:16,160 --> 00:08:17,279
Mom.

155
00:08:18,720 --> 00:08:19,840
Mom.

156
00:08:19,840 --> 00:08:22,080
Mom, I'm calling the police.

157
00:08:27,600 --> 00:08:28,811
Listen to me.

158
00:08:29,000 --> 00:08:30,008
Sweetheart,

159
00:08:30,240 --> 00:08:31,343
listen to me.

160
00:08:31,880 --> 00:08:33,840
He's a ruthless thug.

161
00:08:34,144 --> 00:08:35,560
Once he gets out of jail,

162
00:08:35,560 --> 00:08:37,520
he won't let us live in peace.

163
00:08:38,080 --> 00:08:39,990
Please don't call the police.

164
00:08:40,920 --> 00:08:42,063
Endure it.

165
00:08:43,080 --> 00:08:44,400
Just for a little longer.

166
00:08:44,600 --> 00:08:46,000
- Mom.
- Just endure it.

167
00:08:46,880 --> 00:08:48,360
But for how long?

168
00:08:53,080 --> 00:08:54,680
Mom!

169
00:08:54,680 --> 00:08:56,320
Wake up, Mom!

170
00:08:56,840 --> 00:08:58,030
Mom!

171
00:09:03,940 --> 00:09:07,400
(In operation)

172
00:09:07,400 --> 00:09:08,480
Any family of the patient?

173
00:09:08,480 --> 00:09:09,840
- Any family here?
- Doctor.

174
00:09:09,840 --> 00:09:10,880
Are you her family?

175
00:09:10,880 --> 00:09:12,280
She suffered a major head injury

176
00:09:12,280 --> 00:09:13,440
and has a mild concussion.

177
00:09:13,440 --> 00:09:14,720
But that's not the main issue.

178
00:09:14,720 --> 00:09:16,040
She has been overworked

179
00:09:16,040 --> 00:09:17,040
and stressed for long.

180
00:09:17,040 --> 00:09:19,880
Her heart and liver had
major underlying issues.

181
00:09:20,040 --> 00:09:21,520
This severe trauma

182
00:09:21,520 --> 00:09:22,960
triggered acute heart failure.

183
00:09:22,960 --> 00:09:24,280
Her condition is critical.

184
00:09:24,280 --> 00:09:25,711
She needs to be sent to the ICU.

185
00:09:26,560 --> 00:09:27,602
Doctor,

186
00:09:27,720 --> 00:09:28,821
please.

187
00:09:29,040 --> 00:09:30,280
Please save her.

188
00:09:30,760 --> 00:09:31,880
No matter what,

189
00:09:31,880 --> 00:09:32,925
please save her.

190
00:09:33,600 --> 00:09:34,640
We'll do our best.

191
00:09:34,640 --> 00:09:35,920
But prepare for the worst.

192
00:09:36,377 --> 00:09:39,070
(In operation)

193
00:09:45,960 --> 00:09:48,561
(Is the past tragedy
going to repeat itself?)

194
00:10:00,640 --> 00:10:01,840
(Wait.)

195
00:10:01,840 --> 00:10:04,040
(I wasn't home when Mom died back then.)

196
00:10:05,360 --> 00:10:07,000
(Perhaps she didn't die of illness.)

197
00:10:07,320 --> 00:10:08,675
(She might be...)

198
00:10:12,920 --> 00:10:14,285
(Su Dawei,)

199
00:10:14,720 --> 00:10:16,840
(I will make you pay.)

200
00:10:25,000 --> 00:10:26,560
Hello, Xiaotang.

201
00:10:27,880 --> 00:10:29,000
Ms. Lei,

202
00:10:29,000 --> 00:10:32,040
you said you'd do anything for me.

203
00:10:32,040 --> 00:10:33,400
Does that still count?

204
00:10:33,400 --> 00:10:34,640
Of course, yes.

205
00:10:34,640 --> 00:10:35,960
Xiaotang, just tell me

206
00:10:36,520 --> 00:10:37,648
what you want me to do.

207
00:11:27,035 --> 00:11:30,391
♪The face deep in the heart♪

208
00:11:30,583 --> 00:11:33,045
♪Suddenly clear and hazy♪

209
00:11:34,420 --> 00:11:38,120
♪Across time and space, eyes meet again♪

210
00:11:38,331 --> 00:11:40,771
♪Deeply trapped in the vortex♪

211
00:11:40,918 --> 00:11:43,290
♪Searching for familiar outlines♪

212
00:11:43,440 --> 00:11:46,197
♪Persistently guarding,
endlessly cycling♪

213
00:11:46,197 --> 00:11:48,518
♪Even for just a second♪

214
00:11:49,863 --> 00:11:53,326
♪If raindrops flow backward
into the sky♪

215
00:11:53,454 --> 00:11:55,303
♪And sunlight reverses♪

216
00:11:55,303 --> 00:11:58,773
♪As the sun rises and sets,
we reunite with yesterday♪

217
00:11:59,129 --> 00:12:01,203
♪I'll build a dream with you♪

218
00:12:01,705 --> 00:12:05,114
♪Upon the ruins, spring breeze arrives♪

219
00:12:05,371 --> 00:12:10,583
♪Even if there's no end,
I won't regret the start♪

220
00:12:11,837 --> 00:12:14,402
♪Eternity like a day, rushing to you♪

221
00:12:14,444 --> 00:12:17,897
♪You don't need to recognize my eyes♪

222
00:12:18,474 --> 00:12:21,437
♪Following the tracks
of the days that were♪

223
00:12:22,182 --> 00:12:24,790
♪A day like a lifetime, rushing to you♪

224
00:12:24,790 --> 00:12:28,413
♪You don't need to remember my name♪

225
00:12:28,883 --> 00:12:32,939
♪I'll be the dawn you haven't seen♪
